Z||000000||Fformula88||11-30-2001||10:21 AM||||We set a new Record for snowfall in Buffalo this November!  The record is Zero (0) inches!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Its the first time ever there has not been any snowfall in Buffalo for the month of November!  In fact, today it will be in the 60's!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>Now if it only keeps this up thru the rest of the winter!<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/formulasig.JPG">           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">    <P>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
