Z||000002||MinnGreenGT||11-30-2001||02:39 PM||||There was a record set here a few days ago!  28 inches in about a 30-36 hour period in Willmar, Minnesota!  They have drifts up to 7 feet in depth.<P>Down in the "metro area" we got about 6-8 inches average.  Most of it was wet and sticky too- not much fun for driving!<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
